      sum += it.price * it.qty;
    }
```

**Edit 2 (total):**
Old:
```javascript
    return sub + (sub * this.discount) / 100;
```
New:
```javascript
    return sub - (sub * this.discount) / 100;
```

**Edit 3 (mergeDuplicates):**
Old:
```javascript
    return out.length === this.items.length ? [] : out;
```
New:
```javascript
    return out.length === this.items.length ? this.items : out;
```
